Dear [PERSON_1],

Our tender requirements in short:

- Sorter availability of at least 99.7% measured per operating week.
- Read rate of at least 99.5% for the 1D and 2D barcodes on the top and sides.
- Mis-sort rate below 0.05%.
- Installation must happen while the hub keeps running; any shutdown is limited to one
  Saturday night.
- Remote support 24/7 with a 30-minute response and an engineer on site within 4 hours.
- The sorter controls must be on a network segment separated from our office network.
- Pricing: fixed price, plus a separate 7-year maintenance contract.

We cannot yet tell you which postcode database version we will license next year; the
contract with the provider is under negotiation.

Kind regards,
